      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To handle the OAuth callback and exchange an authorization code for tokens, I need to select a concrete external provider and use its specific API or SDK. I will choose Google as the provider since it is a widely used service with a well-documented OAuth process. The code will include the necessary imports and calls to Google's OAuth2 client library to identify the provider. </thinking>\n",
